step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple robust mean combination on the full pool to establish a baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse error to see if it improves on the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it improves over weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean combination on the full pool to see if trimming improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a single best model hypothesis: FT_rf as the sole predictor to see if single best outperforms weighted ensemble.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a DBA ensemble on the full pool to see if it improves over the single best FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a weighted ensemble with the pooled_meta_model weights on the smaller pool1 to see if a meta-model can improve over the best single FT_rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted ensemble on the smaller robust pool (pool1) using inverse_error weights to see if reducing model diversity improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the smaller, more relevant pool1 to see if reducing model set improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Try a weighted ensemble on pool2 with inverse_error to see if adding more relevant models improves over pool1 weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted ensemble on the full pool using inverse_error weights to see if expanding the model set improves over the current best single model.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median on the slightly larger pool2 to see if it beats the best single FT_rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on pool1 to see if iterative refinement improves over weighted/mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

